 "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_3ygPGpfwcIBNsYPxKFq2waqb|fc_030d9319915759cc016abc6be5d88887d2bb8e94eb1c5a8f6e", "toolName": "bash", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "metadata/org.keycloak/keycloak-client-common-synced/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Keycloak Client Common Synced packages shared Java representations, token and JOSE helpers, crypto utilities, and OIDC client authentication support used by the Keycloak Java client libraries. It is built by syncing selected sources from Keycloak core and common into the standalone client repository so admin, authorization, and policy-enforcer clients can use those APIs without depending on full server modules.\",\nmetadata/org.jgroups/jgroups/5.2.0.Final/reachability-metadata.json:1612:          \"name\" : \"message_processing_policy\"\nmetadata/org.jgroups/jgroups/5.2.0.Final/reachability-metadata.json:1656:          \"name\" : \"message_processing_policy\"\nmetadata/org.jgroups/jgroups/5.2.0.Final/reachability-metadata.json:1676:          \"name\" : \"msg_processing_policy\"\nmetadata/org.jgroups/jgroups/5.2.0.Final/reachability-metadata.json:1911:          \"name\" : \"membership_change_policy\"\nmetadata/io.grpc/grpc-grpclb/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"grpc-grpclb is gRPC Java's implementation of the grpclb load balancing policy plugin. It lets gRPC clients use an external load balancer service and fallback child policies such as round_robin or pick_first when resolving backend addresses.\",\nmetadata/org.jboss.javaee/jboss-jacc-api_JDK4/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"JBoss JACC API provides the Java Authorization Contract for Containers 1.1 interfaces and permission classes under javax.security.jacc. It is used by Java EE containers and applications to define and communicate authorization policy contracts between containers and policy providers.\",\nmetadata/com.android.tools.jack/jack-api/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jack API provides Java interfaces for discovering and configuring Jack compiler providers at runtime. It exposes versioned compilation configuration, task creation, reporting, multidex, collision-policy, and source-version options used by tools that invoke Jack.\",\nmetadata/com.google.cloud/google-cloud-core/index.json:8:    \"description\" : \"Google Cloud Core provides shared foundational types and utilities used by Google Cloud Java client libraries, including service options, retry helpers, paging, IAM policy models, timestamps, and testing support. It supplies common abstractions for credentials, transport configuration, service RPC factories, and base service behavior so individual Google Cloud clients can share consistent runtime infrastructure.\",\nmetadata/com.google.cloud/google-cloud-core/index.json:23:    \"description\" : \"Google Cloud Core provides shared abstractions and base types used by Google Cloud Java client libraries. It includes service options, retry helpers, paging, IAM policy, resource metadata, and other common infrastructure for building and using Google Cloud service clients.\",\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-client/7.5.2/reachability-metadata.json:3289:      \"type\" : \"io.fabric8.kubernetes.api.model.policy.v1.Eviction\"\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-client/7.5.2/reachability-metadata.json:3295:      \"type\" : \"io.fabric8.kubernetes.api.model.policy.v1.PodDisruptionBudget\"\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-client/7.5.2/reachability-metadata.json:3301:      \"type\" : \"io.fabric8.kubernetes.api.model.policy.v1.PodDisruptionBudgetList\"\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-client/7.5.2/reachability-metadata.json:3307:      \"type\" : \"io.fabric8.kubernetes.api.model.policy.v1beta1.Eviction\"\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-client/7.5.2/reachability-metadata.json:3313:      \"type\" : \"io.fabric8.kubernetes.api.model.policy.v1beta1.PodDisruptionBudget\"\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-client/7.5.2/reachability-metadata.json:3319:      \"type\" : \"io.fabric8.kubernetes.api.model.policy.v1beta1.PodDisruptionBudgetList\"\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-client/7.5.2/reachability-metadata.json:3325:      \"type\" : \"io.fabric8.kubernetes.api.model.policy.v1beta1.PodSecurityPolicy\"\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-client/7.5.2/reachability-metadata.json:3331:      \"type\" : \"io.fabric8.kubernetes.api.model.policy.v1beta1.PodSecurityPolicyList\"\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-model-policy/index.json:5:    \"source-code-url\" : \"https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/io/fabric8/kubernetes-model-policy/$version$/kubernetes-model-policy-$version$-sources.jar\",\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-model-policy/index.json:7:    \"test-code-url\" : \"https://github.com/fabric8io/kubernetes-client/tree/v$version$/kubernetes-model-generator/kubernetes-model-policy/src/test\",\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-model-policy/index.json:8:    \"documentation-url\" : \"https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/io/fabric8/kubernetes-model-policy/$version$/kubernetes-model-policy-$version$-javadoc.jar\",\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-model-policy/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Fabric8 Kubernetes Model Policy provides Java model classes for Kubernetes Policy API resources such as PodDisruptionBudget, Eviction, and legacy PodSecurityPolicy. It is part of the Fabric8 Kubernetes Client model set and is used to serialize, deserialize, and build policy resources from JVM applications.\",\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-model-policy/index.json:16:      \"io.fabric8.kubernetes.api.model.policy\"\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-model-autoscaling/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Fabric8 Kubernetes Model Autoscaling provides generated Java model classes and builders for Kubernetes autoscaling API resources, including HorizontalPodAutoscaler, Scale, metrics, and scaling policy types. It is part of the Fabric8 Kubernetes Client model set and lets JVM applications serialize, deserialize, and construct autoscaling resource definitions for use with Kubernetes.\",\nmetadata/io.fabric8/kubernetes-model-gatewayapi/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Fabric8 Kubernetes Model Gateway API provides generated Java model classes and builders for the Kubernetes SIG Network Gateway API resources, including Gateway, GatewayClass, HTTPRoute, GRPCRoute, TLSRoute, TCPRoute, UDPRoute, ReferenceGrant, and related policy objects. It is part of the Fabric8 Kubernetes Client model set and lets JVM applications serialize, deserialize, and construct Gateway API resource definitions for use with Kubernetes.\",\ntests/src/com.nimbusds/nimbus-jose-jwt/3.10/src/test/java/com_nimbusds/nimbus_jose_jwt/Nimbus_jose_jwtTest.java:148:                .criticalParams(Collections.singleton(\"tenant-policy\"))\ntests/src/com.nimbusds/nimbus-jose-jwt/3.10/src/test/java/com_nimbusds/nimbus_jose_jwt/Nimbus_jose_jwtTest.java:149:                .customParam(\"tenant-policy\", \"required\")\ntests/src/com.nimbusds/nimbus-jose-jwt/3.10/src/test/java/com_nimbusds/nimbus_jose_jwt/Nimbus_jose_jwtTest.java:152:        JWSObject jwsObject = new JWSObject(header, new Payload(\"policy protected payload\"));\ntests/src/com.nimbusds/nimbus-jose-jwt/3.10/src/test/java/com_nimbusds/nimbus_jose_jwt/Nimbus_jose_jwtTest.java:157:        assertEquals(Collections.singleton(\"tenant-policy\"), parsed.getHeader().getCriticalParams());\ntests/src/com.nimbusds/nimbus-jose-jwt/3.10/src/test/java/com_nimbusds/nimbus_jose_jwt/Nimbus_jose_jwtTest.java:158:        assertEquals(\"required\", parsed.getHeader().getCustomParam(\"tenant-policy\"));\ntests/src/com.nimbusds/nimbus-jose-jwt/3.10/src/test/java/com_nimbusds/nimbus_jose_jwt/Nimbus_jose_jwtTest.java:162:        MACVerifier policyAwareVerifier = new MACVerifier(HMAC_SECRET);\ntests/src/com.nimbusds/nimbus-jose-jwt/3.10/src/test/java/com_nimbusds/nimbus_jose_jwt/Nimbus_jose_jwtTest.java:163:        policyAwareVerifier.setIgnoredCriticalHeaderParameters(Collections.singleton(\"tenant-policy\"));\ntests/src/com.nimbusds/nimbus-jose-jwt/3.10/src/test/java/com_nim